# Build context excludes.
#
# The compose files build from the repository root (`context: ..`), so without
# this every image would receive the whole working tree — 290 MB by default,
# including:
#
#   * web/node_modules — pnpm's tree is made of SYMLINKS (e.g.
#     @tanstack/react-query -> ../.pnpm/...). BuildKit cannot copy a symlink
#     whose target is a directory and fails the build with
#     "cannot copy to non-directory". It is reinstalled inside the image anyway.
#   * .env — secrets. Images are configured through the environment, never baked.
#   * .devdb, data, bin — local runtime state: the dev Postgres cluster, uploaded
#     CVs, and host-compiled binaries.

# --- secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*

# --- host build artifacts and dependencies ---------------------------------
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
bin
**/*.log

# --- local runtime state ---------------------------------------------------
.devdb
data

# --- version control and editor cruft --------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
